{"id":"mer","lemma":"mer","pos":"noun","rank":745,"glosses":["sea (large body of water)","the ocean (the continuous body of salt water covering a majority of the Earth's surface)"],"ipa":"/mɛʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8a/Fr-mer.ogg/Fr-mer.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"mers"},"formAudio":{"mers":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8e/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Pamputt-mers.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La mer est calme.","en":"The sea is calm.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"calm"}]},{"text":"Je veux voir la mer.","en":"I want to see the ocean.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Le navire est en mer.","en":"The ship is at sea.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"ship"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Il a peur de la mer.","en":"He's afraid of the sea.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"fear"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"]]},{"text":"Le niveau des mers autour du monde s'élève.","en":"Sea levels around the world are rising.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"level"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"around, about"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"world"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"schoolboy"}]}]}